[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0177","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0177.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0200","title":"Microsoft Clip Art Gallery 5.0 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"微软 Clip Art Gallery 5.0（Microsoft Office 组件之一）处理 CIL（剪贴画库）文件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制 CIL 文件并诱使用户打开，触发缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务或在受影响系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞利用需用户交互，影响安装了 Clip Art Gallery 的 Microsoft Office 系统，Microsoft 已通过安全公告 MS00-015 发布补丁修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0200"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12.620","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-015 提供的 Clip Art Gallery 补丁。访问 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyID=ed83e9c7-a80c-44b5-8ff5-f75d6bfdbd9b 下载并安装。如无法安装补丁，可禁用 Clip Art Gallery 对 CIL 文件的自动处理，并在浏览器和邮件客户端中设置不自动下载外部剪贴画内容以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1034","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-015","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19789","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0200.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0200","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0200.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0200.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-36fv-7fxv-xr4g/GHSA-36fv-7fxv-xr4g.json","https://github.com/CERTCC/SBOM/blob/ae581e32992458f65018df4eced684b7370bba39/SwiftBOM/cpe_lookup/cve_lookup/microsoft/greetings_cve.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0200.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--6f011b02-4ffb-49dc-a690-a90cf794e864.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0177.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0182","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0182.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0206","title":"Oracle Oracle8i 标准版 8.1.5 Linux 安装程序本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Oracle 8.1.5.x for Linux 安装程序在创建 orainstRoot.sh 文件时未正确处理符号链接，错误地跟随恶意符号链接并在全局可写权限下生成该文件。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞篡改安装脚本内容，在 Oracle 安装过程中获取 root 权限，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Oracle8i Standard Edition 8.1.5 for Linux 版本，需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0206"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-05T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:13.403","remediation":"升级至 Oracle 8.1.6 或更高版本。安装前检查并清理 `/tmp` 及 Oracle 安装目录中的所有符号链接，确保安装路径不被攻击者控制。安装后立即执行 `chmod 755 $ORACLE_HOME/orainstRoot.sh` 收紧文件权限，并验证该文件所有者是否为 root。如无法升级，在安装脚本运行时以 root 身份监控文件系统变更，确保关键文件不被恶意覆盖。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0023.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1035","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19794","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0206.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0206","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0206.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0206.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mqmj-xph7-4vqh/GHSA-mqmj-xph7-4vqh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0206.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001218.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f7db7bf9-0875-4ec1-85a6-5799142672ee.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0182.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0182.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0182.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0169","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0169.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0192","title":"Caldera OpenLinux 2.3 rpm_query CGI 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Caldera OpenLinux 2.3 默认安装中包含 CGI 程序 rpm_query，该程序未对访问来源进行有效身份验证和权限控制，导致远程攻击者可通过 HTTP 请求直接访问该 CGI 接口，获取系统已安装软件包的详细信息。此漏洞属于信息泄露类型，攻击者无需任何认证即可利用，收集到的软件包信息可用于后续针对性攻击，影响 Caldera OpenLinux 2.3 所有默认安装版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0192"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-05T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11.600","remediation":"删除或移除非必要的 `/cgi-bin/rpm_query` CGI 脚本，或在 Apache 配置中限制对该脚本的访问（如仅允许本地 IP 访问）。建议升级到不再包含此 CGI 程序的 OpenLinux 后续版本，或迁移至受支持的 Linux 发行版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0029.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1036","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19795","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0192.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0192","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0192.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0192.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fwxq-6xvp-vcv7/GHSA-fwxq-6xvp-vcv7.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-misc.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/rpm_query.nasl","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.1179","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0169.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0169.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0169.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0148","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0148.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0168","title":"Microsoft Windows 设备名路径拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 9x 系列操作系统在处理文件路径名时未能正确过滤保留的设备名称（如 CON、NUL、LPT1 等），远程攻击者可向目标系统发送包含此类设备名称的特制路径请求，导致系统资源耗尽或崩溃，造成拒绝服务。此漏洞亦称 \"DOS Device in Path Name\"，影响 Windows 95/98/ME 及 Windows NT 3.5x/2000 等多个版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0168"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:08.537","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Windows 9x/NT/2000 等已停止支持的系统，建议立即升级到 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2016/2019/2022 等受支持版本。对于无法升级的遗留系统，应将其隔离到独立网络段，严格限制外部访问，并通过应用层过滤器拦截包含 DOS 设备名（如 CON、NUL、AUX）的路径请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1043","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2126","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=NCBBKFKDOLAGKIAPMILPCENECCAA.labs%40ussrback.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19799","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/75714a8ac899a2d78a02cc77946dc01b2cac6c38/2000/CVE-2000-0168.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0168","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/9c403f53c634b5fba65371b2388288bf1d7f551e/2000/README.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0168.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0168.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b7ba068a8033bbcf6f889ad58dd7e0ad6c087aeb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vp56-995c-wxvc/GHSA-vp56-995c-wxvc.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0168.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/h/http_w98_devname_dos.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/data/2000.json","https://github.com/adk86/CVE-Vulnerability-Research-Exploit-Analysis"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0148.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0148.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0148.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0181","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0181.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0205","title":"Trend Micro OfficeScan 远程拒绝服务攻击漏洞","description":"Trend Micro OfficeScan 存在远程拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过网络重放管理员命令，未经授权修改 OfficeScan 客户端的配置信息，导致服务异常或中断。该漏洞影响 OfficeScan 早期版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级中等。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0205"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-03T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:13.267","remediation":"立即安装 Trend Micro 官方提供的 OfficeScan 3.5 补丁（下载地址：http://www.antivirus.com/download/ofce_patch_35.htm），修复管理命令重放问题。同时建议在防火墙层面限制对 OfficeScan 管理端口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 地址连接，防止外部攻击者重放管理命令篡改客户端配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0015.html","http://www.antivirus.com/download/ofce_patch_35.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1013","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=D129BBE1730AD2118A0300805FC1C2FE038AF28B%40209-76-212-10.trendmicro.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0205.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0205","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0205.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0205.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r295-x5cr-fmgr/GHSA-r295-x5cr-fmgr.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0205.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001215.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d58100f5-bcd1-403d-9638-85556903467c.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1013/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0181.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0181.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0181.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0151","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0151.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0172","title":"Matt Kimball mtr 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"mtr（My TraceRoute）网络诊断工具在权限降级处理中存在安全缺陷，仅调用 seteuid 而非 setuid 来降低权限，导致有效用户 ID 未被彻底重置。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞在权限降级后通过进程劫持或信号注入等方式重新获取 root 权限，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 mtr 0.28/0.41 及 Turbolinux 3.5/4.2/4.4/6.0 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0172"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-03T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:09.050","remediation":"立即将 mtr 升级至 0.42 或更高版本，该版本已将降权调用从 seteuid() 替换为 setuid()，确保永久丢弃 root 权限。Red Hat Linux/Turbolinux 用户请安装对应发行版安全更新。临时缓解措施：执行 chmod u-s /usr/sbin/mtr 移除 setuid 位（普通用户将无法使用 mtr，仅 root 可执行）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1038","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19796","https://github.com/CVEProject/