ystem() 调用前的输入验证缺陷：对 host_name 和 domain_name 等用户参数使用 Perl 的 quotemeta 函数或手动转义过滤分号(;)、管道符(|)、反引号(`)、美元符号($)等 shell 元字符。如厂商已停止维护无补丁版本，应立即移除 DNSTools CGI 目录或禁用 Web 服务器的 CGI 执行权限；临时缓解措施可在 Web 服务器层配置 mod_rewrite 规则拦截含 shell 元字符的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0000.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1028","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19786","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0177.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0177","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0177/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0177.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0177.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hj4h-cmw3-42v5/GHSA-hj4h-cmw3-42v5.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1028/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/be49e1130e6bdca092999eb707c2ff3d8d256a74/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-01xx/CVE-2000-0177.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8a6655af-4b15-46f4-92b7-3869ff8983b2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0600.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0600.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0170","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0170.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0193","title":"Corel Linux OS Dosemu 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Corel Linux OS 1.0 的 Dosemu 模拟器默认配置存在权限配置不当漏洞，本地攻击者可利用 Dosemu 默认集成的 system.com 程序执行任意系统命令，从而获取提升后的系统权限。该漏洞影响 Corel Linux OS 1.0 版本，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限即可利用，无需认证，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0193"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-02T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11.730","remediation":"升级 dosemu 至 1.2.0 以上版本，或修改 dosemu.conf 配置文件，将 `$_system.com` 设置为禁用，同时限制本地用户对 dosemu 二进制文件的执行权限，仅允许受信任用户组使用。鉴于 Corel Linux 已停止维护，建议迁移至持续更新的 Debian 系发行版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1030","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200003020436.PAA20168%40jawa.chilli.net.au","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19787","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0193.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0193","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0193.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0193.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jw72-8cwx-jh57/GHSA-jw72-8cwx-jh57.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0193.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0170.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0167","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0167.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0190","title":"AOL Instant Messenger 3.5 消息中畸形ASCII值拒绝服务漏洞","description":"AOL Instant Messenger（AIM）3.5 版本客户端存在输入验证漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的畸形 ASCII 值消息，导致 AIM 客户端崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞源于客户端对消息中异常 ASCII 值的处理逻辑缺陷，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，影响所有运行 AIM 3.5 的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0190"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-02T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11.313","remediation":"升级 AOL Instant Messenger 至 4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复畸形 ASCII 消息导致的客户端崩溃问题。由于 AIM 服务已于 2017 年 12 月全面关闭，建议彻底停用该产品并迁移至其他即时通讯方案。如短期无法升级，可在网关或防火墙上禁用 AIM 协议的 OSCAR 端口（TCP 5190）作为临时缓解措施，阻止外部恶意消息触达客户端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0016.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0190.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0190","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0190.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0190.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-72ww-f3xx-777g/GHSA-72ww-f3xx-777g.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0190.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001212.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d1651913-d3fe-461f-8de6-ddda583663c9.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/80642f827c3cd89c2fb8893d0e3fe04ead516ea4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0167.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0668","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0668.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0207","title":"SGI InfoSearch 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"SGI InfoSearch 组件中的 infosrch.cgi CGI 程序存在命令注入漏洞，由于程序未对用户提交的输入进行充分过滤，远程攻击者可通过向 fname 参数中注入 shell 元字符执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 SGI InfoSearch 1.0 及 IRIX 6.5.x 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0207"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:13.523","remediation":"立即安装 SGI 安全公告 20000501-01-P 提供的官方补丁，升级 infosrch.cgi 至修复版本；如无法打补丁，应从 Web 服务器根目录彻底移除 infosrch.cgi 脚本或删除其可执行权限，并在 Apache/Irix httpd 配置中禁用该 CGI 路径。对 CGI 输入参数（如 fname）严格过滤 shell 元字符（; | ` $ () {} <>），并建议迁移至不受支持的 IRIX 版本已终止生命周期，需升级至新一代操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1031","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19788","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0207.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0207","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0207.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0207.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/infosrch.nasl","https://github.com/elastic/integrations/blob/595ae94eea7a80f1083cfcb245ece72d30621ad6/packages/symantec_endpoint/_dev/deploy/docker/sample_logs/symantec_endpoint.log","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-f227-g5q7-7x4w/GHSA-f227-g5q7-7x4w.json","https://github.com/decal/werdlists/blob/81edb463f7f6311c85defefaf75ac9cd58e5cfb9/exploit-info/symantec-attack-signatures.txt","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0668.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0178","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0178.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0201","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer showHelp 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Internet Explorer 5.x 中的 window.showHelp() 方法未限制 HTML 帮助文件（.chm）仅从本地主机执行，远程攻击者可通过 Microsoft 网络共享诱导用户打开特制的 .chm 文件，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 5.x 系列版本，攻击者需结合社会工程学手段诱使用户访问恶意页面或打开恶意帮助文件才能触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0201"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12.747","remediation":"升级至 Internet Explorer 5.5 或更高版本以修复此漏洞，该漏洞的补丁包含在微软 MS00-021 安全公告中。如无法升级 IE，可通过组策略禁用 HTML Help 执行权限或阻止来自不受信来源的 .chm 文件下载。鉴于 IE 已停止支持，建议迁移至 Microsoft Edge。如仍须使用旧版 IE，务必在受限环境中运行并启用最高安全级别。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1033","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0201.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0201","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0201.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0201.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-489p-9hgq-jg94/GHSA-489p-9hgq-jg94.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0201.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2c2e5f6f-3a39-42df-928a-348b2f4bc4b3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/80642f827c3cd89c2fb8893d0e3fe04ead516ea4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0178.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0178.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0166","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0166.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0189","title":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.x 版本中存在服务器信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求访问 application.cfm 或 onrequestend.cfm 文件，即可获取服务器的真实物理路径信息。该漏洞利用方式简单且易于探测，泄露的路径信息可被用于后续更深入攻击的信息收集阶段，增加系统被进一步入侵的风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0189"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11.173","remediation":"升级到 Adobe ColdFusion 2018 或 2021 及以上版本（该漏洞仅影响 ColdFusion 4.x 及更早版本）。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面配置规则阻止对 application.cfm 和 onrequestend.cfm 的直接访问；同时将 ColdFusion 管理台的错误处理设置为自定义错误页，关闭详细错误信息显示，防止路径泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1021","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0189.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0189","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0189.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0189.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4rjq-mf8f-5v58/GHSA-4rjq-mf8f-5v58.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0189.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001207.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2777226d-5035-4a7f-bf4e-606245495156.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0166.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0166.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0608","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0191","title":"Axis Communications StorPoint CD 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"Axis Communications StorPoint CD 网络存储设备存在身份认证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何认证即可通过向管理员 URL 中添加 `..` 目录遍历序列，绕过访问控制机制直接访问受限制的管理后台页面，获取设备完全控制权限。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，影响范围广泛。厂商已发布固件更新修复此漏洞，建议用户及时升级。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0191"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-29T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11.463","remediation":"升级 Axis StorPoint CD 固件至 3.0 及以上版本，该版本修复了路径遍历认证绕过漏洞；若无固件更新可用，应在防火墙或反向代理中限制对设备管理页面的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理网段访问。此外，禁用不必要的 Web 管理接口可降低暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/19","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1025","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=41256894.00492503.00%40mailgw.backupcentralen.se","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19784","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0191.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0191","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0191/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0191.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0191.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qxm8-579x-6fj9/GHSA-qxm8-579x-6fj9.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/axis.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_500_600.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0191.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0608.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0608.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0191","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0191.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0216","title":"Microsoft Outlook/Exchange/Windows Messaging 邮件自动应答拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook、Exchange 及 Windows Messaging 等电子邮件客户端存在自动响应邮件回执标签的设计缺陷，远程攻击者可通过伪造发往大型通讯组列表的阅读回执请求，触发大量自动应答邮件，导致目标邮件系统因响应洪泛而发生拒绝服务。该漏洞利用无需身份认证，攻击条件简单，影响范围广泛。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0216"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-29T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:14.723","remediation":"建议安装 Microsoft 安全更新 MS00-009，升级 Outlook/Exchange 至已修复版本；或在客户端设置中禁用\"自动发送阅读回执\"选项，同时在 Exchange 服务器端限制回执请求重定向到通讯组列表，防止邮件泛洪攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q1/0176.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0216.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0216","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0216.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/nvd_advisories/CVE-2000-0216.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2